Z||000008||PJ||06-11-2001||07:46 AM||||Hey Shaun, what's going on? FWIW I'm building up the 3.1L and just ran some cc numbers. Head volume was 48.5cc with SI valves. Compression with flat top pistons at zero deck height, stock bore is 10.06 to 1. If you go .040 over it goes up to 10.27. Formula88, looks nice. Gonna plug that crank timing hole?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>PJ<BR>ITA #66 Black<BR>||||reg||1
